(7631014, 1236829, 65234, '<td valign="top">The flowers stand out brilliantly from the rest of the scene. Very nicely seen.</td>', 'The flowers stand out brilliantly from the rest of the scene. Very nicely seen.', '2019-05-27 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7631015, 1237077, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like that you got the iris in bud, bloom, and decay. Nice circle of life image. Going back and forth about the processing, but an Iris is a curvy sort of flower, so the swirling effect suits that. Still think I''d like to see it as a straight photo for comparison. Background and light are nice. One of my high scorers.</td>', 'I like that you got the iris in bud, bloom, and decay. Nice circle of life image. Going back and forth about the processing, but an Iris is a curvy sort of flower, so the swirling effect suits that. Still think I''d like to see it as a straight photo for comparison. Background and light are nice. One of my high scorers.', '2019-05-27 10:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
